| Loads the VideoCore stand-ins: RISC OS's VCHIQ, BCMSupport and PCI
| modules' SWIs, answered with Linux's /dev/vchiq and /dev/vcio, so that
| programs written for the Raspberry Pi's VideoCore (ReelHWAccel: Reel,
| Matinee, FFmpeg's h264_vchiq) work under RISC OS for Linux on a Pi 3/4.
| VCHIQ won't load where Linux has no VideoCore (QEMU, UTM, other
| machines), so the programs decode in software there.
|
| Copyright (c) 2026 Andrew Youll. MIT licence (see LICENSE).
RMEnsure VCHIQ 0 RMLoad <Obey$Dir>.VCHIQ
RMEnsure BCMSupport 0 RMLoad <Obey$Dir>.BCMSupport
RMEnsure PCI 0 RMLoad <Obey$Dir>.PCI
